Supabase Local SMTP Configuration for Online Email Delivery
Copy this file to `supabase/.env` to send real emails to online inboxes.

OPTION 1: 
1. Sign up at https://resend.com
2. Get an API key (e.g. re_123456789)
SMTP_HOST="smtp.resend.com"
SMTP_PORT=465
SMTP_USER="resend"
SMTP_PASS="re_your_api_key_here"
SMTP_ADMIN_EMAIL="onboarding@resend.dev"
SMTP_SENDER_NAME="CIVIL-LEX"

OPTION 2: Gmail SMTP (Personal or Workspace Gmail)
1. Go to Google Account > Security > 2-Step Verification > App passwords
2. Generate a 16-character App Password for "Mail"
SMTP_HOST="smtp.gmail.com"
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER="your.email@gmail.com"
SMTP_PASS="abcd efgh ijkl mnop"
SMTP_ADMIN_EMAIL="your.email@gmail.com"
SMTP_SENDER_NAME="CIVIL-LEX"

OPTION 3: Brevo / SendGrid / Custom SMTP
SMTP_HOST="smtp-relay.brevo.com"
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER="your-login"
SMTP_PASS="your-smtp-key"
SMTP_ADMIN_EMAIL="noreply@yourdomain.com"
SMTP_SENDER_NAME="CIVIL-LEX"
